stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE --> PARSE_RESUME: start()
    PARSE_RESUME --> ANALYZE_JD
    ANALYZE_JD --> PLAN
    PLAN --> INTERVIEW
    INTERVIEW --> INTERVIEW: answer() 且未到题量上限
    INTERVIEW --> CROSS_EXAM: 题量用完
    CROSS_EXAM --> EVALUATE
    EVALUATE --> REPORT
    REPORT --> DONE
    DONE --> [*]
